  "title": "A Fantastic Voyage: HuBMAP Human Reference Atlas Workshop Offers Virtual Reality Tour of Human Organs and the Data Inside Them",
  "bodyHtml": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Funded by his</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://hubmapconsortium.org/jumpstart-program/#andreas2024\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>HuBMAP JumpStart Fellowship</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, Andreas Bueckle from Indiana University organized an interactive</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://cns-iu.github.io/workshops/2024-10-24-jumpstart-workshop/\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>two-day workshop</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> on the Human Reference Atlas (HRA) Organ Gallery, an open-source virtual reality (VR) tool enabling users to interactively tour 3D human organ models and data inside them. The main goal was to enable face-to-face collaboration to integrate data from four other junior investigators into a suitable scale of the HRA Organ Gallery app that also features novel 3D multiscale HRA navigation and manipulation. The workshop was held in collaboration with Meghan McCarthy, Phil Cruz, and Kristen Browne from the</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.niaid.nih.gov/research/bioinformatics-computational-biosciences-branch\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>Bioinformatics and Computational Biosciences Branch</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> at the NIH National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases (NIAID) and was supported by the</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://hubmapconsortium.org/jumpstart-program/\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>NIH HuBMAP JumpStart Fellowship 2024-2025</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and NIAID Branch Chief Darrell Hurt. The virtual reality application is freely available</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.meta.com/en-gb/experiences/hra-organ-gallery/5696814507101529/\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>here</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">. A paper describing the concept of the application is available</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fbinf.2023.1162723/full\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>here</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">. More information about Andreas’ work is available</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://andreas-bueckle.com/\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>here</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(66, 66, 66);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;border-width:medium;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:inline-block;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;height:500px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;width:572px;\"><img style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeA0ub17WhiIpex5pf1Kqp86iDrRxfTz9bx1NXQKez4cRG1QLyI-5KqGC0RA5QQv-ZYpcKYNph8wFupOBzIma1T4VOANDQzPjpGJPS_QJysOroEIBzkjJxBE_J15ppYrH2ovUSaDw?key=Aiu3EKYSSrWrex-jTOEsCECu\" width=\"572\" height=\"500\"></span></p>",
  "summary": "The HuBMAP HRA presents a workshop on its open-source virtual reality tool featuring 3D human organ models and the data inside them",
